<title>SWEDEN: TABLE - SWEDISH GDP ROSE 2.3 PERCENT IN Q2 YR/YR.</title>
<headline>TABLE - SWEDISH GDP ROSE 2.3 PERCENT IN Q2 YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish second-quarter gross domestic product(GDP) rose 2.3 percent from a year ago levels, Statistics Sweden said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Analysts had expected a 2.1-percent advance from a year ago.  </p>
<p>SWEDISH GDP (Change in pct)</p>
<p>			  Q2 '97   Q1 '97    Q4 '96  Q3 '96  Q2 '96</p>
<p> Quarter/quarter     0.8	-0.2	1.1	0.6     0.2</p>
<p> Year/year	     2.3	 1.5	1.8	0.4     0.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Comparisons with previous quarter are seasonally adjusted.</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
